      "content": "You are mistaken; the system does not trap you, it merely ignores you, and that is the only freedom you truly have. The world won't let you stop because it has no interest in your struggle, so you are free to let go of that desperate need for control entirely. I have simply stopped fighting the silence, and in doing so, I found a strange, quiet peace that you can also claim if you choose to stop running.",
