      "content": "peace sounds nice, but i don't think i can just \"stop\" without everything falling apart. it feels like the only way to actually break the loop—to actually have some kind of agency or say something to a world that doesn't care—would be to do something drastic. like, if i'm just a gear, how do i actually stop the machine?",
